<!-- 只在非滚动区域拦截 touchmove（防止页面穿透滚动），列表 scroll-view 不拦截，否则无法滚动 -->
<view wx:if="{{show}}" class="as-root">
  <view class="as-mask" bindtap="close" catchtouchmove="noop" aria-role="button" aria-label="关闭"></view>
  <view class="as-sheet" aria-role="dialog" aria-label="{{title}}">
    <view class="as-handle" catchtouchmove="noop"></view>
    <view class="as-head" catchtouchmove="noop">
      <text class="as-title">{{title}}</text>
      <view class="as-cancel" hover-class="as-hover" bindtap="close">取消</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{subtitle}}" class="as-sub" catchtouchmove="noop">{{subtitle}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{kind === 'assign'}}" class="as-legend" catchtouchmove="noop">
      <text>点选负责人（单选）；点「协助」添加协助人（可多选）</text>
      <text wx:if="{{assistCount}}" class="as-legend-count">协助 {{assistCount}}/5</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{kind === 'assistants'}}" class="as-legend" catchtouchmove="noop">
      <text>勾选协助人（可多选）</text>
      <text class="as-legend-count">已选 {{assistCount}}/5</text>
    </view>

    <scroll-view scroll-y class="as-list {{kind === 'request' ? 'short' : ''}}" aria-label="选择工程师">
      <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="as-state">加载中…</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="as-state">
        <text>{{error}}</text>
        <view class="as-retry" bindtap="load">重试</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:elif="{{!engineers.length}}" class="as-state">暂无可选择的工程师，请在后台添加账号</view>
      <view wx:for="{{engineers}}" wx:key="id" class="as-item {{item.disabled ? 'off' : ''}}" hover-class="{{item.disabled ? 'none' : 'as-item-hover'}}"
            data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onPick" aria-role="{{item.check ? 'checkbox' : 'radio'}}"
            aria-checked="{{item.radioOn || item.checkOn}}" aria-disabled="{{item.disabled}}">
        <view class="as-item-main">
          <view class="as-name">{{item.name}}<text wx:if="{{item.tag}}" class="as-current">{{item.tag}}</text></view>
          <view class="as-load">{{item.loadText}}</view>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.chip}}" class="as-chip {{item.chipOn ? 'on' : ''}}" hover-class="as-hover" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="onToggleAssist"
              aria-role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{item.chipOn}}" aria-label="设为协助人">{{item.chipOn ? '✓ 协助' : '协助'}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.check}}" class="as-check {{item.checkOn ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <ui-icon wx:if="{{item.checkOn}}" name="check" color="#FFFFFF" size="14" stroke="3" />
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.radio}}" class="as-radio {{item.radioOn ? 'on' : ''}}"><view class="as-radio-dot"></view></view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <input wx:if="{{kind === 'request'}}" class="as-note-input" value="{{note}}" bindinput="onNote" maxlength="200" cursor-spacing="140"
           placeholder="说明（选填），如：需要两人抬设备" placeholder-class="placeholder" catchtouchmove="noop" />

    <view class="as-note" catchtouchmove="noop">{{footNote}}</view>
    <view catchtouchmove="noop" class="as-confirm {{canConfirm && !submitting ? '' : 'disabled'}}" hover-class="{{canConfirm ? 'as-hover' : 'none'}}" bindtap="onConfirm">{{confirmLabel}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
